{
    "pageid": 143,
    "title": "Titular Title Generator",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The Titular Title Generator is a mod which generates higher tier titular titles from existing titles."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Features",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Creates higher titular titles for every landed duchy and kingdom. The lower tier title is required to create the title (e.g. to create the Kingdom of Leinster, you would need the Duchy of Leinster as your primary title.)",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Ability to use an existing mod as a base to create new titles, and creates an addon for it.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Can choose to only generate kingdoms or empires.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Can output short names. For example: Leinsterian Kingdom instead of Kingdom of Leinster. English only.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Selectable culture restrictions:",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "None: No cultural restrictions. A character of any culture can create the title.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Culture: To create the Kingdom of Leinster, your character would need to be Irish.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Culture Group: To create the Kingdom of Leinster, your character would have to be Irish, Scottish, Welsh, or Breton to create it.",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Selectable religion restrictions:",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "None: No religious restrictions. A character of any religion can create the title.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Religion: To create the Kingdom of Leinster, your character would have to be Catholic, or a heresy of Catholic to create it.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Religion Group: To create the Kingdom of Leinster, your character would have to be Christian to create it.",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Selectable lower-tier-title requirements:",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Duchies: To create a kingdom, you would need this number of duchy titles (minimum of 2).",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Kingdoms: To create an empire, you would need this number of kingdom titles (minimum of 2).",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Can make new titles de jure liege of currently held titles.",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Replace De Jure Unchecked: You create the Kingdom of Leinster with the Duchies of Munster and Leinster, both remain de jure Kingdom of Ireland.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Replace De Jure Checked: You create the Kingdom of Leinster with the Duchies of Munster and Leinster, both are new de jure Kingdom of Leinster.",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Can clear title history.",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Counties: All county, duchy, kingdom, and empire histories are wiped. A new character is created, and a single county is assigned to it. You'll need to start a new game with that character, save, and then reload as another county.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Duchies: All duchy, kingdom, and empire histories are wiped.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Kingdoms: All kingdom and empire histories are wiped.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Empire: All empire history is wiped.",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
